From: HackerOS Linux System <hackeros068@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 20/35] hackeros: PACKET_MMAP ring buffer rozszerzony dla red team

Rozszerza AF_PACKET MMAP ring buffer (TPACKET_V3) o dodatkowe
opcje wydajnosciowe dla narzedzi red team (tcpdump, wireshark, scapy).
Zwiekszony rozmiar ring frame dla zminimalizowania strat pakietow.

---
 net/packet/af_packet.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

--- a/net/packet/af_packet.c
+++ b/net/packet/af_packet.c
@@ -4817,3 +4817,10 @@
 MODULE_DESCRIPTION("Packet socket support (AF_PACKET)");
 MODULE_LICENSE("GPL");
 MODULE_ALIAS_NETPROTO(PF_PACKET);
+
+#ifdef CONFIG_HACKEROS_REDTEAM
+/* HackerOS Red Team: PACKET_MMAP ring buffer parametry dla high-perf capture.
+ * hackeros_packet_ring_frames: domyslna liczba klatek (4096 = ~256MB). */
+static __maybe_unused unsigned int hackeros_packet_ring_frames __read_mostly = 4096;
+static const int hackeros_packet_mmap_redteam __initconst = 1;
+#endif /* CONFIG_HACKEROS_REDTEAM */
--
